  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong>摩天大樓城市（萊克維爾）</strong></em></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>使用地形改造技術從頭創建的地圖。由三個大型城市組成，每個城市風格各異。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>您可以探索充滿房屋和摩天大樓的廣闊區域。</span><span>有些建築已進行裝飾，而有些則尚未完成（仍在開發中）。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>每座城市都採用獨特的風格建造，並包含某些不同的元素，但它們彼此相連。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>外部裝飾與周圍建築相得益彰。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>如果您喜歡我的作品，可以通過我的 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#f1c40f\"><strong>Patreon 帳戶</strong></span> 支持我：<a href=\"patreon.com/Minecreator_666\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">patreon.com/Minecreator_666</a></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b;text-decoration:underline\">地圖：</span></strong></em></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b;text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_67436de3-3fec-4a02-848f-dd391533d88d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b;text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f2eca539-8802-49bf-ad6c-8389410004a3.png\" alt=\"\"></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b;text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_6c29096f-2e8a-457b-ab66-c3943ea39c12.png\" alt=\"\"></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b;text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_3bb0e978-bbbc-44f4-98f8-c21ec1d7b52f.png\" alt=\"\"></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b;text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_3fc62c98-5e95-4b6b-ab7d-ec1ff807e922.png\" alt=\"\"></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b;text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_145d6c4f-783b-4739-a40a-6fdd282ce60e.png\" alt=\"\"></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b;text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_df681258-cbb8-475e-a23e-d60af951ea05.png\" alt=\"\"></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b;text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_33be2cae-6aa7-4ce1-845c-efac9089eaed.png\" alt=\"\"></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b;text-decoration:underline\">更新：</span></strong></em></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>下一次更新將對地形和室內設計進行全面重做。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>開發團隊也在創建迷宮和興趣點，以提供更好的遊戲體驗。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>希望您喜歡這個地圖，我也非常期待聽到您的意見。</span></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong><span>冒險開始！</span></strong></em></span></h3>",
